  m_Text: "River Cleanup!\nThe river is full of rubbish \u2014 help clean it up!\nDrag
    recycling into the GREEN bin\nDrag general waste into the BLACK bin\nDrag special
    gold coins into the YELLOW bin\nDon't pick up the fish \u2014 they're alive!\nMiss
    an item or use the wrong bin and you'll lose a heart!\nReach 500 points to save
    the river!\nGood luck! \n"
